[TEXT] **Root cause identified!** r1's FRR running config has **no OSPF process at all** — just a loopback. r1 has a kernel default route via ispa but is NOT redistributing it into OSPF. csw1 and csw2 confirm this: neither has a default route in their tables. Let me verify r1's stored frr.conf to confirm this is the injected fault vs. design intent.
